| RCI-3 EPD名 | **COBRE** | Medium |
| RCI-4 Phase | **Training** | — |
| RCI-5 N | **434**（Table S1: CNP 110 + COBRE 73 + DIRECT 251）※抄録の255は誤記の可能性 | Low |
